-         row  `Integrity`  8  _a packet failed its integrity check_  its AEAD check
+         row  `Unexpected(message)`  2  _the server sent an unexpected message `message`_  `SSH_MSG_UNIMPLEMENTED` を表す `3` を含む：このクライアントが送ったものをサーバーが理解しなかった
+         row  `NoCommonAlgorithm(kind)`  3  _the server offers no supported `kind` algorithm_  `key exchange`、`host key`、`cipher` のいずれか
+         row  `HostKeyRejected(keyType)`  4  _the server's `keyType` host key was not accepted_  `Ssh.HostKeys` ポリシーが鍵を拒否した
+         row  `BadSignature`  5  _the server's signature over the exchange is wrong_  交換ハッシュに対するホスト鍵の署名の検証に失敗した
+         row  `Disconnected(code, text)`  6  _the server disconnected with code `code`: `text`_  サーバーが `SSH_MSG_DISCONNECT` を送った
+         row  `ClosedConnection`  7  _the connection was closed_  メッセージの途中でソケットが閉じた
+         row  `Integrity`  8  _a packet failed its integrity check_  AEAD の検査

-         row  `ServiceRefused(service)`  9  _the server did not accept the service `service`_
+         row  `ServiceRefused(service)`  9  _the server did not accept the service `service`_

-         row  `Unauthenticated(methods)`  10  _no identity was accepted; allowed: `methods`_  no signer was accepted; the methods are those the server would allow, `publickey` or `publickey,password`
-         row  `Agent(detail)`  11  _the SSH agent `detail`_  the `ssh-agent` could not be reached, did not list its keys or refused to sign
-         row  `ChannelRefused(detail)`  12  _the server refused to open a channel: `detail`_  a session channel
-         row  `RequestRefused(kind)`  13  _the server refused the `kind` request_  an `exec` request
-         row  `Unreachable(reason)`  14  _the server could not be reached: `reason`_  the TCP connection could not be made; carries the `Socket.Error.Reason`
