-   entry #disconnect   ends the connection politely with `SSH_MSG_DISCONNECT` (by application), and closes the duplex
-       RFC 4253 §11.1. `Session#close` calls this, and an `Ssh.Endpoint`'s session does so
-       when its block ends.
