-       form requires; the digest is SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 by curve. Needs an
-       `Ssh.Provider` in scope.
-   entry .rsa   the `Identity` for `Rsa[2048]`, `Rsa[3072]` and `Rsa[4096]` keys, as `rsa-sha2-256`
-       SHA-256 over PKCS#1 v1.5. Needs an `Ssh.Provider` in scope.
